X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://www.ncarboretum.org/event/world-bonsai-day-3/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T180000
DTSTAMP:20260508T122422
CREATED:20260204T183832Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260204T183832Z
UID:10016902-1778324400-1778349600@www.ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:World Bonsai Day
DESCRIPTION:World Bonsai Day\nMay 9\, 2026\n11:00 a.m. – 6:00 p.m.\n  \nWorld Bonsai Day weekend May 9 marks the official opening of the Arboretum’s internationally acclaimed Bonsai Exhibition Garden\, with trees filling the benches for the first time since fall! \nArthur Joura\, Bonsai Curator at The North Carolina Arboretum\, will present a free live bonsai demonstration in the Bonsai Exhibit Garden at 1 p.m. \nTo mark the occasion\, the Blue Ridge Bonsai Society will be onsite with educational displays and to answer questions from visitors. \nThe North Carolina Arboretum is a World Bonsai Friendship Federation Cooperation Center\, one of only eight so designated bonsai gardens across the world which all celebrate World Bonsai Day each year by presenting bonsai experiences to the public. \nThe World Bonsai Day celebration is included with the Arboretum’s regular parking fee. \nThis event is part of Spring Into the Arb! Celebrate the return of spring with a series of events and happenings throughout March\, April\, May and June! Spring is a time of renewal and emergence\, and The North Carolina Arboretum is excited to welcome this season with plant shows\, nature programs\, education\, music\, art and more!
URL:https://www.ncarboretum.org/event/world-bonsai-day-3/
LOCATION:Bonsai Exhibition Garden
CATEGORIES:Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Untitled-design.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Livemusicasheville": "https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jazz-brunch-w-four-peanuts-trio-2/2026-05-09/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:livemusicasheville
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T143000
DTSTAMP:20260508T234758
CREATED:20260326T163613Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260424T083607Z
UID:10059043-1778326200-1778337000@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Jazz Brunch w/ “Four Peanuts” trio
DESCRIPTION:Jazz Brunch is now officially on the schedule for every Saturday here in the taproom! We’re so very excited to introduce our newest free weekly event\, open to all ages\, family & pet-friendly\n\n\n\n\nWe’ll have an extra special brunch menu\, craft beer\, mimosas\, and of course\, beer-mosas\, all alongside jazz music from the talented jazz fusion trio\, “Four Peanuts”. The group explores both original compositions and zesty covers of tunes you may or may not know. The trio features Alex Taub on keyboards\, Brennan Dugan on bass\, and Joe Enright on drums\, and will certainly leave your peanuts salted and boiled to perfection.\n\n\n\nJazz Brunch will take place every Saturday from 11am-2pm at French Broad River Brewery\, with a special brunch menu from @frenchbroadriverpizza🍕 \nIt is our hope that many of our community and new friends may join us in making Saturday dayzzz special here in the taproom this spring☀️ Cheers! \n\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jazz-brunch-w-four-peanuts-trio-2/2026-05-09/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
