DESCRIPTION:You’ve heard of MAHEC . You know it does important work. But
  what does that really mean for Western North Carolina—and for your busi
 ness? Join us on Tuesday\, May 19\, from 8 – 9 a.m. For Business BEFORE 
 Hours on MAHEC’s beautiful 14-acre campus\, conveniently located just of
