SUMMARY:Slow Art Friday
DESCRIPTION:Join our volunteer educator for this week’s Slow Art Friday and experience how close looking can foster relaxation and connection.
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/slow-art-friday-16/2026-05-22/
