DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 31st\n\n1st Dance 
 Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wa
 ve 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nLIVE Music 
 w/ Servants of Music\nIntention: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note th
 at the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle
  and people who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensu
 re a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name you
 r price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-regist
 ration Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOL
