BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Asheville Runners": "https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/jlcknsyjckbdb/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_asheville_runners
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_jlcknsyjckbdb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260509T034752Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/jlcknsyjckbd
 b/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20210805T131517Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20210805T131517Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Haywood County Walking Meetup Group": "https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/events/314585809/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_haywood_county_walking_meetup_group
X-SOURCE:Haywood County Walking Group
UID:event_314585809@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260509T034757Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T123000
SUMMARY:Historic Columbia SC Morning Walk—Governor's Mansion\, Finlay Pa
 rk\, and More!
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nMeet at 10:00 a.m. in the
  lobby of the Hampton Inn\, 822 Gervais Street\, Columbia 29223 (enter the
  lobby from the Lincoln Street side). Restrooms are available at the start
  point.\n\nThe trail takes you past the Woodrow Wilson Boyhood Home\, arou
 nd the Governor's Mansion\, through the newly reopened Finlay Park\, and t
 hrough Memorial Park.\n\nThere are some moderate hills and stair climbing\
 , but it is almost entirely on pavement. Tennis shoes are fine\; some may 
 want walking sticks or hiking boots.\n\nDress for the weather. It will lik
 ely be very hot. A hat and sunscreen are highly recommended.\n\n**Plenty o
 f water** and a protein snack are advised as always. Wheelchairs are not r
 ecommended\, although strollers ought to be ok. Dogs are welcome.\n\nOur M
 eetup group offers some version of this walk every three months. It's that
  good! You will surely enjoy it.\n\nTraditionally\, many of us eat at Five
  Guys (near the start point) after the walk. There are lots of other resta
 urants nearby. Give yourself plenty of time to enjoy your meal after you j
 oin the group for the walk.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/314585809/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260501T224119Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260501T224119Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
